[{"speaker":"","text":"虽然没有摆脱被兽灵附身的现状，但茉子也没有再变成小狗。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"因此我们的交往非常顺利。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"白天我们形影不离。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"一起吃无可挑剔的便当。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「今天也做得很好吃，茉子」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a494","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「只要你喜欢吃，我也会很开心的」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a587","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那请问……将臣……现在可以吗？」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2619","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔……嗯，当然可以」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2619","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"面对茉子的请求，我确认四周没人之后用力点了点头。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2619","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"接着茉子就迫不及待地把嘴唇压了上来。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2619","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯嗯……将臣……」","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔、嗯嗯……」","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们已经是第几回这样接吻了？","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"不知从什么时候开始，午餐后的接吻已经成了我们的习惯。","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"也正因为如此，我至少已经不会再当场僵住了。","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"即使她搞突然袭击，现在的我也能够从容地用双唇应战了。","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯……唔……」","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯嗯嗯、嗯呼……嗯、嗯……嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯哈……将臣」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2621","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……茉子」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2621","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈哈……接吻真的好神奇啊」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2609","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「怎么亲都亲不腻。我反而觉得……亲得越多心跳越快」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2609","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，确实」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2609","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们现在的吻仅仅是将彼此的双唇重合在一起。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2609","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但即便如此也舒服得不得了，经常会让我处于极为兴奋的状态。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2609","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「最近……我好像渐渐明白一些了」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2622","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「明白什么了？」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2622","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「让接吻更舒服的诀窍」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2622","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2622","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的轻言细语让我不由得愣住了。","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2622","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「茉子，我怎么觉得你……有点色色的啊」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2611","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我最近也发觉了。其实自己是个非常下流的女孩子……」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2082","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「你讨厌下流的女孩吗？」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2623","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「说实话，那要看是怎么下流了……」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2623","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果只在我面前下流，那我最喜欢了」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2623","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那当然啦……只有在你面前，我才会这样」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2613","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「……Ｍｕａ」","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们的双唇再度轻轻贴在一起。","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但这回没有再大战三百回合，仅仅是点到为止。","art":{"background":"a2620","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「对不起，我忍不住了……哈哈」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……再、再亲一次可以吗？」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2603","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「再这么亲下去……就没完没了，上课会迟到的」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2624","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「最后一次，就再亲最后一次」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2624","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「真是的……真的是最后一次了啊」","art":{"background":"a498","sprites":[{"asset":"a2625","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我开始撒娇央求，而茉子也没有拒绝。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们已经忘乎所以，即便是在学校里也敢偷偷接吻。","art":{"background":"a1","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「今天有什么想吃的吗，将臣」","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[{"asset":"a2281","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「吃什么都可以。只要是你给我做的，全都很好吃」","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[{"asset":"a2281","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈哈……这种回答是最让人头疼的。不过能听到你这么说，我很高兴」","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[{"asset":"a809","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们的热情丝毫不见衰退，彼此间的对话简直就像一对结了婚的夫妻。","art":{"background":"a493","sprites":[{"asset":"a809","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"而在家里——","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「将臣，你现在有空吗？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「有空的。其实我就是在等你」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈哈，太好了。那我打扰了」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"面带羞色的茉子走进了我的房间。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a2626","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"进来后，她立刻坐到了我的身边。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「你在做什么呀？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a330","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我在复习功课。因为今天上课的时候有点精神不集中」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a330","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「出什么事了？莫非是锻炼太辛苦了？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a321","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不是锻炼的问题。毕竟最近不需要猛练」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a321","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「那为什么没法集中精神呢？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a550","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「当然是因为我满脑子装的都是你」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a550","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a2339","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈哈，又说这么羞耻的话」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a2348","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我这么说你应该不讨厌吧？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a2348","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「虽然很难为情……但我最爱听了，哈哈」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a2348","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"茉子露出了开心的笑容，把手放在了我的左手上。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a2348","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「将臣，你是右利手对吧？我不会打扰你的，可以让我就这么握着吗？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a281","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「呃……真伤脑筋」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a281","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「不可以吗……？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a280","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你要是一直握着我的手，我的心会跳得很快的」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a280","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「因为你的手软软的、暖暖的……光是握着就很舒服」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a280","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「其实……我也跟你一样。你的手很大，很厚实，看上去就很有力气」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a250","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「不仅让我心跳加速……还让我有很有安全感……男性的手掌就是不一样啊」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a331","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈哈……确实不能一直牵着手，这样我也没法集中精神了」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a552","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「对吧？所以暂时休息一下吧」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a552","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嘿咻」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a552","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我合上笔记本，屁股一挪，身体向茉子靠去。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a552","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「反正也没心思学习，干脆贴得更紧一些好了」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a552","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-42.857142857142854,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯……紧紧贴在一起吧」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a251","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"茉子点了点头，也挪动屁股把身体靠了过来。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a251","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你的身体真暖和」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a251","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嘿嘿嘿……一直这样靠着没问题吧？」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a246","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那当然。因为我们是情侣啊」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a246","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯，我们是情侣」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a251","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我最喜欢你了，茉子」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a251","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「我也最喜欢你了♪」","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[{"asset":"a249","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们就这样享受着二人独处的时光。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"感情一点一滴地在彼此心中慢慢沉淀。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们的恋情也变得越来越坚不可摧。","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"能清楚地体会到这段过程，我非常开心——","art":{"background":"a360","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但同时也感到有些痛苦。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我躺在被窝里，眼睛盯着着天花板。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我已经像这样躺了很久了……但是完全没有睡意。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"理由显而易见。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「身体好热……」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"左半边身体好像还残留着茉子的体温。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"好想进一步……感受这份温暖。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我想用全身去感受茉子，而不是像现在这样只有部分身体留有余韵……","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我好想……跟茉子一起睡……」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"跟茉子接吻很舒服，让人相当兴奋。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"其实每次和她接吻，我都会这么想。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"因为有变成兽奸的危险，所以之前我一直在刻意避免……但如果她一直没有变成小狗……","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哎……我很担心自己哪天会把持不住……」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「茉子已经睡了吗？」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果还醒着的话……她现在会在想些什么呢？」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"}]